{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vr9OigMht71795145782.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報有阿里巴巴股東提出集體訴訟，指控公司涉及隱瞞及欺詐。</p><p></p><p>根據美國法院收到的入稟狀，阿里巴巴被指控於2024至2026年報告中，蓄意大幅低估因違反出口管制對業務造成損害的風險，從而推高股價。</p><p></p><p>入稟狀又提到，公司與新加坡Megaspeed有業務往來，指控阿里隱瞞與對方公司前高層黃樂的關係，藉此欺詐投資者。阿里巴巴首席執行官吳泳銘也被列為被告。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.270691+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:17:12.723148+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:17.596794+00:00","content_hash":"845dd5c7d74fd12097e272fa5b9e495a1a44477336ad3fb32a0e73f3d82ac7c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.270691+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}